    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Thin stream and straining; no retention, fever, or blood</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Weight stable; no fever</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or breathlessness on long walks</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Persecutory beliefs unchanged; less time spent on them; no hallucinations; no thoughts of suicide or of harming anyone</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

