 hernia management. HerniaSurge Group. Hernia 2018;22(1):1-165 (2018)</paragraph><paragraph>Follow-up: Urethroplasty in two weeks; catheter removal at about three weeks with a urethrogram; primary care review one week after the catheter comes out. Next scheduled visit 1767-04-21: review four weeks after urethroplasty; start of aripiprazole. [S]</paragraph></text>

